hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19263","Waki narrated to us, Zamah narrated to us from Isa ibn Yazdad from his father who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When one of you urinates then let him shake his penis three times. Zamah once said: That suffices him."
"19264","Rawh narrated to us, Zakariyya ibn Ishaq narrated to us from Isa ibn Yazdad ibn Fasaah from his father who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When one of you urinates then let him shake his penis three times."
